  319: 	#  21 -> 22 on 2026-08-30: `#496` wired gdrom_cond_probe.py into gate_sh_rounding.sh
  320: 	#  with a literal denominator pin (`check "gdromcond rows run" ... 20`).  Same
  321: 	#  deliberate raise, and the growth arm named this file and this line when it fired --
  322: 	#  which is the property that makes the check worth its noise.
