  334: 		bad "  This is not a failure -- it means a new gated probe arrived.  Raise"
  335: 		bad "  SCORE_CLAIMS_MANIFEST to $_spinned in tools/precommit_check.sh, deliberately."
  336: 		bad "  Growth is caught on purpose: a floor that only catches shrinkage goes"
