The gate mixes staged filenames with working-tree contents. Section D has a stronger defect: it uses plain `git diff`, so fully staging a change leaves it no added lines to inspect. There’s also a correction to Q3: the root `CLAUDE.md` is outside this repository; J compares that external file with the working-tree copy under `tools/`.
