 109: def basename_matches(name):
 110:     """How many files under the search roots share this basename.
 112:     *** AMBIGUITY IS THE DISCRIMINATOR, AND IT IS MECHANICALLY CHECKABLE. ***  Three seats
 113:     landed in three places on bare citations -- one wanted them to FAIL, one wanted a WARN,
 114:     and I had shipped a silent count.  The adjudication threads all three on ambiguity:
