 142:     cannot MASK the tracked copy, which is true and beside the point: they can SUBSTITUTE
 143:     FOR ITS ABSENCE.
 145:     Found by the opus5 seat reading the SEARCH list against the README instead of reading
 146:     the PASS line.  *** IT IS THE THIRD INSTANCE OF ONE SHAPE IN THIS SINGLE FILE *** --
