tools/pipeline\ledger.json:1551:   "witness": "harness:offline differential of the SAME driver against `git show 39748e3:src/core/timer.c` -- 12 rows on t->interval == 1.0/t->freq, 0 fails on shipped, 5 fails on upstream. NOT a rung-2-4 witness and must not be read as one: it is a rung-1 direct-call detector, which the ladder says is NEVER a reproduction. It proves the row was real (not vacuous) and that the defect is gone; it does not prove the path was guest-reachable -- and separately grep shows t->freq is read NOWHERE outside timer.c, so the guest could never have observed it."
